The firm began as an engineering survey practice and says it has worked with some of the biggest mining companies in Africa, from greenfield projects through to mine closure. Its 3D scanning is used to obtain accurate, up-to-date as-built data for engineering functions. It suits mining, infrastructure and energy clients who need accurate survey data quickly, and its office is in Doornpoort, Pretoria.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://africansurveyors.com/', '$[#]', 'https://africansurveyors.com/pretoria/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'african-consulting-surveyors-doornpoort' AND description = 'African Consulting Surveyors (ACS) is a precision surveying and geospatial solutions firm formed in 2000, offering airborne and mobile LiDAR mapping, 3D scanning and hydrographic surveys to the mining, construction and infrastructure sectors across Africa from its Doornpoort office.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
