Beyond manufacturing, it offers lighting compliance consulting, on-site assessments for new and existing installations, audio-visual systems including digital signage and LED displays, generator supply and maintenance, and signal distribution design. Repairs can be booked through its website. It suits industrial operators and facility managers who need compliant, durable lighting and integrated systems supported locally, and the company is based on Cradock Avenue in Lyttelton Manor, Centurion.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://afrison.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'afrison-led-kloofsig' AND description = 'Afrison LED is a Lyttelton Manor-based manufacturer of high-end industrial LED lighting and energy-efficient lighting solutions, also offering energy audits, retrofit installations, audio-visual systems and IoT solutions; the company was acquired by White Pearl Technology Group in August 2025.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
