The firm says it has delivered data-driven mining solutions to more than 1,800 clients and that it is now part of AFRY, which adds a wider footprint across Australia, Canada, South Africa and the UK. The company expects the partnership to let it deliver larger, more complex projects across the mining lifecycle. It suits mining companies that need technical studies or advice at any stage, and the office is at Byls Bridge Office Park in Doringkloof, Centurion.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.amcconsultants.com/', '$[#]', 'https://www.amcconsultants.com/about'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'amc-consultants-centurion-centurion-central' AND description = 'AMC Consultants is a global mining consultancy providing geological, geotechnical and mining engineering services to the resources sector, operating from a Centurion office; the firm was founded in 1983 and has advised more than 1,800 mining clients worldwide.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
